  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt the same time as the bears are introduced, 20 wolves are introduced into the sanctuary. Their population is expected to increase by 15% every year. When will there be more wolves than bears?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eFind the exponential function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo increase a value by 15%, multiply it by 1.15.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo after 1 year, the bear population will be\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e20 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18696\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo find the population after 2 years, multiply by 1.15 again.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e(20 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18697\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15) \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18698\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15, or\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e20 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18699\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15\u003csup\u003e2\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eAfter 3 years:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e20 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18700\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eAfter \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e years:\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e20 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18701\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15\u003ci\u003e\u003csup\u003ex\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, the function we need to enter is \u003ci\u003ey\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 20 \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18702\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 1.15\u003ci\u003e\u003csup\u003ex\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/i\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18703\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18703\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and, for Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e, enter the function.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18704\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qyeq.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18704\u0026quot;,265)\"\u003e and, for Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e, enter the function as\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18705\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18706\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q0.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18707\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtimes.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18707\u0026quot;,238)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18708\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18709\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18709\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18710\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18711\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18712\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qcap.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18712\u0026quot;,113)\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18713\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18713\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_10b_50/f-50-10b-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eView the table.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18714\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_18715\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtable.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_18715\u0026quot;,228)\"\u003e to view the table.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_10b_50/f-50-10b-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eScroll down until the Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e column is greater than the Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eScroll down until the Y\u003csub\u003e2\u003c/sub\u003e column is greater than the Y\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThis occurs first when \u003ci\u003ex\u003c/i\u003e \u003d 11.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eSo, after 11 years, there are more wolves than bears.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-7 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_6_1_proportionsandratios_10b_50/f-50-10b-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
